Platform prerequisite
---------------------
VB6MCP is an add-in for Microsoft Visual Basic 6.0 (VB6) and forms its MCP
server surface. Using or building it requires a licensed installation of VB6
owned by the user. No Microsoft binaries, type libraries, designer files or
other Microsoft components are distributed with this project; the build
expects the user to supply them from their own VB6 installation (see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

