Research modules
----------------
Parts of this project (the optional Vba6Probe module) interoperate with
Microsoft's VBA6 debug-engine exports by calling them from inside the host
IDE process. Those modules are development and diagnostics aids; they are
documented as such and are not required to use the MCP server surface.
